# The agent currently reads no environment variables.
#
# Secrets live in git-ignored files instead:
#   credentials.json  Google OAuth "Desktop app" client (download from Google Cloud Console)
#   token.json        created on first sign-in; gmail.readonly only
#
# If a later level adds an AI model for drafting replies (Junior), its key goes here, e.g.:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
